abstract: 'Complete research materials for finite modular rounding and statistical simulation: the thesis,
  four papers, exact verification programs, numerical checks and recorded results. Extensive assistance
  from ChatGPT (OpenAI) is disclosed in the publications and AUTHORS_AND_AI.md. Software uses MIT; project-authored
  texts, original figures and research-data compilations use CC BY 4.0 to the extent applicable, as described
  in LICENSING.md.'
